Package: seqscribe
Title: A Plain-Language Analysis Workbench for Sequencing Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Mayank", "Tandon", email = "mtandon09@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny workbench that lets an analyst direct routine
    bioinformatics analyses in plain language. A locally hosted large language
    model translates requests into calls to a library of standardised analysis
    functions, recorded in a validated analysis specification from which
    scripts and R Markdown reports are rendered. Bulk RNA-seq is the first
    supported workflow.
